<description>&lt;p&gt;CAR forces have finished Rwanda special forces and basic special operations training and have neutralised 34 Boko Haram and ISWAP fighters in the Lake Chad area. The UN Security Council renewed the MINUSCA mandate to 2027, lowered the troop ceiling to 12,000 and set a gradual drawdown of peacekeepers. Saudi backing now funds a second year of a counter-terrorism programme for Sahel states centred on Chad. Tensions are rising between Chad and Niger as regional realignments shift, and a prison break in Chad caused two inmate deaths and 30 escapes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQMFVaWXhzTktWc0lqOUVGWHl0ZXBSRTlUY2JwZXFBaGhKUVFlekhQTzdWZnN6b0dXRXRrWWhYWTRfTmE0aGRoem11NXRRR3ZLS2NZbFRVWURkNUMtcUcwSFNmcU1pMU03OVpabGZvamRBNTFhRkRtVGEtQ3dwbUVvUWdDamdvV0Qyb3pCN3hRQ3RwTGp1Y2I3eHVtcXJRYTZpbDNIb0lJZkphZlBtMmwyaFlWRlNQNDBD?oc=5&quot;&gt;Audacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxObHlwQ04yRDhMMVhZYkMwRXp1ZmFMeS1EV0NqeTFMMTZzR04yS1ZSU3o3UWNuSkxQN3hnTjdnZ0dfMGlfaVJIREdYaXQ1OXRpd0N4VnVMclBMRXgxaHNycHE5cDhkQUNhRER3dURNQlcxaWN4N0VEbmYzZjQxaWhDa3NkdWJ4dnhM?oc=5&quot;&gt;Audacy&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxNY0dqcW10WFE5U3dYS1Rabl9tb2FPS0Y5WlNIdnJGVDU2dTRZZ0R2MlFDUVR4ZDNHTTFwSEFLdXQtNEdjYUFWSThXNHh3MWttWlFzYmoyUkNnVFNFYVpiN2hLX0ZiS2VaYjZMUnNHVXVSWFRPbnpkWmZJWnZoSUVobDBiS290aWdMT0I1VGVLTmQta2N3Q1pmR01kX0ZrMTJndFRNUlhuTW8xZkozakljSHIxMDVoaWQyWXVBczNvYURPR255dWc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Sahara Reporters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQcUFCRHN5T19wcFJzSEw2WWNmWDRWS1V5VWZvcFNNLTNiRlBhMDlmVVhQNmNkTWZNN25lM28yQXlQamlNc0N3TWZZcThhVXloU2dlaTd6RHhmTTR4VzZUNElEUkMxOFlEQVUtMnd0c2NfeTlnWVZtZkVCM3NxQ3hlOHpyS0dld3l6XzFLQUxmeGM3Vk9tZzVqUnA3ZGRPWkQzRGxlNXk2LV9qMGUtOUZMNDhUaWU?oc